'''Polar bears''' are large [[neutral mobs]] that live in icy [[biome]]s. Adult polar bears are protective of their babies, attacking [[player]]s that get too close or attack any babies near them.

== Spawning ==
Polar bears spawn in [[Snowy Plains|snowy plains]], [[Ice Spikes|ice spikes]], [[Frozen ocean|frozen]] and [[deep frozen ocean]] biomes, and additionally/sometimes in [[frozen river]], [[legacy frozen ocean]], [[snowy slopes]], [[jagged peaks]], and [[frozen peaks]] biomes {{in|BE}}. They spawn in groups of up to two, above [[ice]]. {{IN|JE}}, polar bears don't spawn on ice in snowy plains and ice spikes biomes. If there is a group, the second polar bear is a baby.

{{Mob spawn table|Polar Bear}}

